      "caption": "Pro to club #1: the press.\n\nElite sides press with their front three screening the middle, forcing the ball wide. Copy that on a Saturday and your 9 is done by the 15th minute.\n\nThe club version: give them the first pass, trap the second. Use the sideline as your extra defender and keep it to three calls: show wide, lock, back.\n\nTry it for 15 minutes this weekend and tell us how it went.\n\n#fieldhockey #hockeytactics #clubhockey #englandhockey #hockeycoaching #hockeyplayer",
