      "slides": 6,
      "caption": "Pro to club #2: the penalty corner.\n\nThe pros inject, stop and drag flick it into the top corner. Most club sides haven't got a drag flicker, and a high first hit is a free out anyway.\n\nThe club version: stop it dead, hit it flat and low at the far post, and have someone on that post with their stick on the floor. Three calls: straight, slip, follow.\n\nBe honest: what's your side's corner conversion rate this season?\n\n#fieldhockey #hockeytactics #penaltycorner #clubhockey #hockeycoaching #englandhockey",
